        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    from datetime import datetime\n\n    # Define variables name and value\n    grant_date = datetime.strptime(\"2021-01-15\", \"%Y-%m-%d\")\n    exercise_date = datetime.strptime(\"2022-02-20\", \"%Y-%m-%d\")\n    sale_date = datetime.strptime(\"2023-05-05\", \"%Y-%m-%d\")\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    held_after_exercise = (sale_date - exercise_date).days > 365\n    held_after_grant = (sale_date - grant_date).days > 730\n    answer = held_after_exercise and held_after_grant\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
